# Executive Summary

This project focuses on building a **Customer Behaviour Analytics Dashboard** using **Power BI** to analyze customer purchasing patterns, revenue contribution, demographic trends, and subscription behaviour.

The dashboard transforms raw retail data into interactive business insights through KPIs, charts, slicers, and category-based analytics. The system helps stakeholders monitor customer engagement, product performance, and business growth using visual reporting.

---

# 1. Introduction

Retail businesses generate large amounts of customer and transaction data daily. Analyzing this data manually is inefficient and time-consuming.

The objective of this project is to develop an interactive Power BI dashboard capable of converting customer data into meaningful business insights.

The dashboard focuses on:

* Customer segmentation
* Revenue analysis
* Product category performance
* Subscription analysis
* Demographic behaviour

