# 7. DAX Measures

## Total Customers

```DAX
Total Customers = DISTINCTCOUNT(Customer[Customer_ID])
```

## Average Purchase

```DAX
Avg Purchase = AVERAGE(Customer[Purchase_Amount])
```

## Revenue

```DAX
Revenue = SUM(Customer[Purchase_Amount])
```

These measures dynamically calculate business metrics within the dashboard.

